& [Purpose]
  + form SWA-01 as one pure provider-free admission compiler from an exact admitted SOP revision to a proposed Cantor agent-session identity
  + preserve SOP source signature procedure admission session proposal process launch workspace authority and work execution as distinct stages

& [Profiles]
  + [SBS-001] request profile is cantor-sop-boot-session-request/0.1
  + [SBS-002] proposal profile is cantor-sop-boot-session-proposal/0.1
  + [SBS-003] every form denies unknown fields and deterministic JSON is the only machine form

& [SOPRevisionBinding]
  + [SBS-004] canonical SOP revision source procedure-candidate and satisfaction-signature identities are explicit and distinct
  + [SBS-005] exact lower-case SHA256 identities bind the SOP revision and satisfaction-signature artifact
  + [SBS-006] source digest equals every validation compilation verification and admission candidate-source digest and candidate identity equals every candidate reference

& [AdmissionChain]
  + [SBS-007] validation compilation and verification dispositions are Passed and Observer decision is Admit
  + [SBS-008] receipt identities and all compiler IR procedure anchor effect bounds policy and predecessor references correspond exactly
  + [SBS-009] every receipt digest is rederived with existing cantor_core digest functions
  + [SBS-010] permitted invocation context is exactly cantor_sop_boot_session_proposal/0.1 and exact revocation conditions are SOP revision admission outer-host identity or objective change
  + [SBS-011] every receipt has nonempty evidence and empty residual and diagnostic sets

& [SessionProposal]
  + [SBS-012] request boot-request proposed-session and outer-host identities are distinct and the outer-host envelope objective and authority are exact SHA256-bound
  + [SBS-013] bounds require one future work packet one through 64 checkpoints one through 32 update proposals and one through 86400 seconds
  + [SBS-014] one through 32 request evidence references are mandatory
  + [SBS-015] unresolved account is exactly sop_bytes_not_observed process_not_launched workspace_not_admitted and objective_not_executed
  + [SBS-016] exact denials are process launch workspace read workspace mutation commit push provider call persistence external effect and SOP activation
  + [SBS-017] output lifecycle is proposed_not_launched authority is identity_and_planning_only and the request is retained unchanged
  + [SBS-018] request and proposal digests are domain-separated SHA256 and validation rederives complete correspondence

& [Faults]
  + [SBS-019] profile identity digest revision admission chain evidence bounds unresolved lifecycle authority correspondence and machine-form faults are typed and fail closed
  + [SBS-020] any request receipt output denial lifecycle authority or digest mutation refuses without partial output

& [Acceptance]
  + [SBS-A01] preserved source canonical explosion review signature plan matrix and lock bind exactly
  + [SBS-A02] valid admitted-SOP fixture compiles validates serializes and byte-identically replays
  + [SBS-A03] receipt disposition correspondence digest evidence context revocation identity bound unresolved denial and unknown-field substitutions refuse
  + [SBS-A04] focused debug release warnings-denied lint format workspace regression evidence attribution scoped publication and replay gates pass

& [Delineation]
  + an admitted SOP revision and proposed session identity are inside
  + source-byte observation signature issuance session opening process launch objective selection workspace access work checkpoints updates commit push provider self-SOP authorship activation and effects are outside

